>## Show an incorrect unification error as a string
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term incorrectUnificationError = λe.let subst := checking.IncorrectUnificationError[substitution] e in strings.concat2 "incorrect unification: " (typing.typeSubst subst)
